  "limits": "The veins are a single family of turbulent sine bands, so they run broadly parallel; branching and crossing veins of real marble are not reproduced. Object coordinates tie the pattern to the object's scale. The subsurface weight is small and stylized, not measured. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
